MFLOW 2
NAME Circuit: well pump
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Q1 feeds the circuit (red L, blue N rails).\nSA1 in AUTO: LS1 closes while Pool01 is below\n30% and opens at 80%; LS2 opens if Well01\nruns dry. KM1 then runs motor M1 = Pump01.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Click SA1 to switch OFF / HAND / AUTO.\nSet Pool01 low (Properties): the pump starts.\nPress ES1, open Q1, or trip OL1 (Properties):\nH2 shows the fault. Reset to run again.

