LABEL 96.00 96.00 EXAMPLE 10 - WELL PUMP CIRCUIT\nAn electrical cabinet runs the well pump:\nbreaker, fuse, E-Stop, a HAND / AUTO selector,\nfloat switches, contactor, overload, lamps.
